    {
      "v": 11,
      "zh": "用迷术的、交鬼的、行巫术的、过阴的。",
      "en": "one who casts spells,[NOTE:1] one who conjures up spirits,[NOTE:2] a practitioner of the occult,[NOTE:3] or a necromancer.[NOTE:4]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “a binder of binding” (חֹבֵר חָבֶר, khover khaver). The connotation is that of immobilizing (“binding”) someone or something by the use of magical words (cf. Ps 58:6; Isa 47:9, 12).",
        "Heb “asker of a [dead] spirit” (שֹׁאֵל אוֹב, shoʾel ʾov). This is a form of necromancy (cf. Lev 19:31; 20:6; 1 Sam 28:8, 9; Isa 8:19; 19:3; 29:4).",
